n check should be added via addRRsetWithoutLock and leave the zone's soaRecord unchanged."}]}, {'group': 'Successful addition – SOA RRset', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'rrset', 'value': 'RRset mock: type=SOA, name=origin (example.com.), size=1, firstRecord=SOARecord instance'}], 'expected': 'RRset is added and zone.soaRecord is set to the SOARecord contained in the RRset; no exception is thrown.', 'description': "A valid SOA RRset (owner equals zone origin and exactly one record) must be added and the zone's internal soaRecord field must be updated to the first record of the RRset."}]}]
